  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Greetings. I have been expecting you.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720065006500740069006E00670073002E00200049002000680061007600650020006200650065006E00200065007800700065006300740069006E006700200079006F0075002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lady Jacinthe is waiting for you. Please come to\nthe Society of Battle Connoisseurs battling area.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let me spell it out for you—go downstairs.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAs you well know, nothing good can come from\nkeeping Lady Jacinthe waiting.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My dear <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00790020006400650061007200200010000201000000002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You have my sincerest thanks for requesting the\nInfinite Z-A Royale to be held as your reward for<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nreaching Rank A.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In fact, it delighted me so much that I decided to\nhold a tournament of my own! It is called...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le Super-Tournoi de Jacinthe O!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0065002000530075007000650072002D0054006F00750072006E006F00690020006400650020004A006100630069006E0074006800650020004F002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Care to guess what the <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>O<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> stands for,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 15,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD060000004300610072006500200074006F002000670075006500730073002000770068006100740020007400680065002000100002FF000006004F00100002FF0000000020007300740061006E0064007300200066006F0072002C000A0010000201000000003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Out-of-this-world?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00750074002D006F0066002D0074006800690073002D0077006F0072006C0064003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oasis?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0061007300690073003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Only?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E006C0079003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ordinary?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F007200640069006E006100720079003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors, incorrect! My tournaments are already out\nof this world, so adding that would be redundant.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, a good guess! I am an oasis of beauty and\ncharm, but that is not the intended meaning.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Correct! Splendid!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F007200720065006300740021002000530070006C0065006E006400690064002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "As if any one of my endeavors could be described\nas ordinary!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007300200069006600200061006E00790020006F006E00650020006F00660020006D007900200065006E0064006500610076006F0072007300200063006F0075006C00640020006200650020006400650073006300720069006200650064000A006100730020006F007200640069006E006100720079002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This is a tournament between “only” you and me.\nThus, Le Super-Tournoi de Jacinthe O!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No matter how many battles you win, your next\nopponent will always be me!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Furthermore, you may face me as many times as\nyou like, whether or not you manage to win the<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nentire tournament!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 119
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So, do you understand now?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F002C00200064006F00200079006F007500200075006E006400650072007300740061006E00640020006E006F0077003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Of course",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006600200063006F00750072007300650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not really",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00740020007200650061006C006C00790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, using an O in your reply! How clever of you,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C0020007500730069006E006700200061006E0020004F00200069006E00200079006F007500720020007200650070006C0079002100200048006F007700200063006C00650076006500720020006F006600200079006F0075002C000A0010000201000000002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Honestly! As much as I know you love the sound\nof my voice, that is no way to keep me talking.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now, let us begin. I am certain you will fully\nappreciate my brilliance once you experience it!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let the tournament begin!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00650074002000740068006500200074006F00750072006E0061006D0065006E007400200062006500670069006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Another time, maybe",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E006F0074006800650072002000740069006D0065002C0020006D00610079006200650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A word of advice: it would be wise to battle Lady\nJacinthe as soon as you can.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors, what a shame...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBut I do hope you will try again another time.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A most heartfelt congratulations on your victory.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410020006D006F0073007400200068006500610072007400660065006C007400200063006F006E00670072006100740075006C006100740069006F006E00730020006F006E00200079006F0075007200200076006900630074006F00720079002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allow me to heal your Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4112,
